<title>USA: Revlon holding co sells $500 mln 144A debt.</title>
<headline>Revlon holding co sells $500 mln 144A debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following high-yield debt issue from Revlon Worldwide Corp was priced in the 144A private placement market on Friday, according to sources.</p>
<p>Chase Securities Inc was lead manager on the deal.</p>
<p>BORROWER REVLON WORLDWIDE CORP</p>
<p>AMT $500 MLN	 COUPON ZERO	 MATURITY 3/15/2001</p>
<p>TYPE SNR DISC NOTE ISS PRICE 65.59   FIRST PAY DATE N/A</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S NR    YIELD 10.75 PCT   PAY FREQ N/A</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-MINUS			   CALLABLE NON-CALL THREE</p>
